UNINUS Weather Station Card — Attribution Notice

This project is a derived work based on Lovelace Windrose Card:
https://github.com/aukedejong/lovelace-windrose-card

The historical wind-data acquisition, matching, conversion, configuration,
and wind-rose rendering implementation originated in that upstream project.
The UNINUS Weather Station Card adds its own custom element, weather-station
presentation, current-condition fields, rain classification, responsive
layout, packaging, and documentation around that implementation.

